ble.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dense}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dense}\\)</span> (dense-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"681e6314e26cdd0b\" href=\"?note=681e6314e26cdd0b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-dense.md\">../batch10/58-df-dense.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compatible}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Compatible}_S\\)</span> (compatibility predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"2ad4b32e9e2eb12a\" href=\"?note=2ad4b32e9e2eb12a\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-compatible.md\">../batch08/58-df-compatible.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\)</span> (本文件固定的纯成员语言编码, using <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"58-df-first-order-language.md\">58-df-first-order-language.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S\\)</span> (一阶语言谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"58-df-first-order-language.md\">58-df-first-order-language.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S,\\mathrm{Univ},I^{(-)}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S,\\mathrm{Univ},I^{(-)}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\\)</span> (结构数据, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HereditarilyKappa}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HereditarilyKappa}_S\\)</span> (遗传大小谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"8670ef2cc176069b\" href=\"?note=8670ef2cc176069b\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-hereditarily-kappa-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-hereditarily-kappa-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (正则基数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HTheta}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{HTheta}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (本文件定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\theta\">\\(H_\\theta\\)</span> 载集及成员结构谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper\\text{-}membership\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\n\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\right\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper\\text{-}membership\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\n\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\right\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper\\text{-}h\\text{-}theta}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\nH=\\{x\\in V\\mid\\mathrm{HereditarilyKappa}_S(x,\\theta)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper\\text{-}h\\text{-}theta}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\nH=\\{x\\in V\\mid\\mathrm{HereditarilyKappa}_S(x,\\theta)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper\\text{-}membership\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L_{\\in})\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)=M\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land I^{\\mathfrak M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\n=\\{a\\in M^2\\mid a(0)\\in a(1)\\}\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper\\text{-}membership\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L_{\\in})\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)=M\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land I^{\\mathfrak M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\n=\\{a\\in M^2\\mid a(0)\\in a(1)\\}\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathcal L=\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\forall\\theta,H,\\mathfrak H,M,\\mathfrak M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H,\\theta)\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_P\\in H\n\\land M\\subseteq H\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_P\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H)\n\\land\\mathfrak M\\prec_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}\\mathfrak H\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\cap M\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(\nq\\leq_Pp\\land\\forall D\\in M\\;(\n\\mathrm{Dense}(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}\\to\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_Pq\\to\n\\exists d\\in D\\cap M\\;\\mathrm{Compatible}_S(d,r,\\mathbb P,\\leq_P)))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathcal L=\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\forall\\theta,H,\\mathfrak H,M,\\mathfrak M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H,\\theta)\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_P\\in H\n\\land M\\subseteq H\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_P\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H)\n\\land\\mathfrak M\\prec_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}\\mathfrak H\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\cap M\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(\nq\\leq_Pp\\land\\forall D\\in M\\;(\n\\mathrm{Dense}(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}\\to\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_Pq\\to\n\\exists d\\in D\\cap M\\;\\mathrm{Compatible}_S(d,r,\\mathbb P,\\leq_P)))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Proper}(\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\leq_P\\;\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L_{\\in})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Proper}(\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\leq_P\\;\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Proper forcings preserve <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\theta\">\\(H_\\theta\\)</span>、纯成员语言以及两个成员结构均显式构造；因此不存在通过选择一个没有任何初等子模型的任意语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 而使定义真空成立的退化路径。</li>\n<li>内层“对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\leq q\">\\(r\\leq q\\)</span>”表达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\cap M\">\\(D\\cap M\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 以下 predense；原文件只要求某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 相容，条件过弱。</li>\n<li>Many standard forcings are proper.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md","status":"resolved","id":"faf104362ffe13b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-dense.md","status":"resolved","id":"681e6314e26cdd0b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-dense.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-compatible.md","status":"r