thfrak M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H,\\theta)\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_P\\in H\n\\land M\\subseteq H\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_P\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H)\n\\land\\mathfrak M\\prec_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}\\mathfrak H\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\cap M\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(\nq\\leq_Pp\\land\\forall D\\in M\\;(\n\\mathrm{Dense}(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&\\hspace{45mm}\\to\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_Pq\\to\n\\exists d\\in D\\cap M\\;\\mathrm{Compatible}_S(d,r,\\mathbb P,\\leq_P)))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Proper}(\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\leq_P\\;\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L_{\\in})","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"r\\leq q","display":false},{"tex":"D\\cap M","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false}],"bytes":4085,"backlinks":[{"id":"fee1253e7ff15977","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HTheta}_S$ and $\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S$ (canonical hereditary-size carrier and membership structures from [[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]])"},{"id":"0b163842f6e1db06","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S$ 使用 [[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]；赋值函数的定义域为 $\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}$。"},{"id":"12fe2c789b4c78f9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"36b4649dd248921c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_{\\in}$ 是规范的纯隶属语言编码，$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})$（see [[../batch06/58-d